	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Save to Sploot: share original JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, MP4 or WebM files, or a direct HTTP/HTTPS media URL. No page scraping or social-player downloading. GIFs and videos are not converted. Only Sploot receives your personal API token.

The token can save and search; it cannot list or delete your library. First run asks for a token from https://www.sploot.app/app/settings and stores it as plaintext in iCloud Drive/Shortcuts/sploot-upload-token.txt (not Keychain). Run without shared media to replace it. Revoke old tokens in Sploot settings; never share the token file.

Get Contents of URL exposes the JSON receipt, not an HTTP status variable. success + asset + isDuplicate distinguishes the published 201/409 outcomes. Network/JSON decoding failures stop in Shortcuts with an error, never a Saved message.</string>
				<key>UUID</key>
				<string>8D72DB7E-3C14-4D86-91FB-90A89C8407AA</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
